+/*                                                                    */
+/*  Chain: AccessUnit → ExtraData → EvoFrame → EvoPayload(id=11)     */
+/*         → object metadata payload with object positions.           */
+/*                                                                    */
+/*  Position encoding (raw object metadata):                          */
+/*    X: 6 bits unsigned / 62.0 → [0,1]                              */
+/*    Y: 6 bits unsigned / 62.0 → [0,1]                              */
+/*    Z: 1 sign bit + 4 bits / 15.0 → [-1,+1]                        */
+/*                                                                    */
+/*  Output coordinates (DAMF):                                        */
+/*    x_out = (x_raw - 0.5) * 2.0     [-1,+1] left-right             */
+/*    y_out = (0.5 - y_raw) * 2.0     [-1,+1] front-back (inverted)  */
+/*    z_out = z_raw                    [-1,+1] below-above            */
+/* ------------------------------------------------------------------ */
